msgstr "sistem;viri;sredstva;monitor;merilnik;procesi;raba;opravila;upravitelj;CPE;CPU;RAM;pomnilnik;GPE;GPU;hitrost;napajanje;baterija;moč;energija;poraba;"

#: data/org.gnome.Resources.metainfo.xml.in.in:17
msgid ""
"Resources allows you to check the utilization of your system resources and control your running processes and apps. It’s designed to be user-friendly and "
"feel right at home on a modern desktop by using GNOME’s libadwaita."
msgstr ""
"Viri vam omogočajo, da preverite izkoriščenost sistemskih virov in nadzirate tekoče procese in programe. Zasnovan je uporabniku prijazno in se počuti kot "
"doma na sodobnem namizju z uporabo programa libadwaita v GNOME."

